*** Keywords ***
Start LTE Uplink Test
    [Documentation]
    ...  Starts LTE Uplink Test Module via admin API. It goes in two manners - if cell technology is TDD, then downlink test module is also
    ...  needed to run in parallel. FDD cells do not need such operation.
    ...  If parameter activate_parallel_dl_test_for_tdd is True, parallel LTE DL Test Model E-TM1.1 will be started before Uplink test
    ...  only for TDD cell configuration. For FDD cell, parallel LTE DL Test Model run is not required.

    [Arguments]  ${distname_realtime}
    ...          ${test_model}
    ...          ${earfcn_ul}
    ...          ${phy_cell_id}
    ...          ${reporting_time_interval}
    ...          ${resource_block_offset}
    ...          ${digital_output_type}
    ...          ${tdd_spec_subf_conf}
    ...          ${tdd_frame_conf}
    ...          ${connection}
    ...          ${timeout}=60
    ...          ${activate_parallel_dl_test_for_tdd}=${True}

    ${cell_technology}=                                     admin_info_model.get_cell_technology
    ...                                                     connection=${connection}
    ...                                                     cell_type=lte
    ...                                                     cell_id=${distname_realtime[-1]}

    Run keyword if       ${activate_parallel_dl_test_for_tdd} and '${cell_technology}'=='TDD'
    ...   Run keywords
    ...   Robot Log Operation                               Starting LTE Downlink Test (E-TM1.1) before ${test_model} Uplink Test.
    ...   AND
    ...   tm_lte_adm.start_lte_downlink_test                distname_realtime=${distname_realtime}
    ...                                                     test_model=E_TM1_1
    ...                                                     earfcn=${earfcn_ul}
    ...                                                     phy_cell_id=${phy_cell_id}
    ...                                                     tdd_spec_subf_conf=${tdd_spec_subf_conf}
    ...                                                     tdd_frame_conf=${tdd_frame_conf}
    ...                                                     connection=${connection}
    ...                                                     timeout=${timeout}

    Robot log operation                                     Starting LTE UL ${test_model} test model...
    ${start_test_result}                                    tm_lte_adm.start_lte_uplink_test
    ...                                                     distname_realtime=${distname_realtime}
    ...                                                     test_model=${test_model}
    ...                                                     earfcn=${earfcn_ul}
    ...                                                     reporting_time_interval=${reporting_time_interval}
    ...                                                     resource_block_offset=${resource_block_offset}
    ...                                                     digital_output_type=${digital_output_type}
    ...                                                     tdd_spec_subf_conf=${tdd_spec_subf_conf}
    ...                                                     tdd_frame_conf=${tdd_frame_conf}
    ...                                                     timeout=${timeout}
    ...                                                     connection=${connection}
    Should Be Equal As Strings                              ${start_test_result['status']}
    ...                                                     Succeeded
    ...                                                     msg=LTE UL ${test_model} test model start failed: ${start_test_result['msg']}
    Robot Log Step                                          LTE UL ${test_model} test model has started successfully.

Stop LTE Uplink Test
    [Documentation]
    ...  Stops LTE Uplink Test via admin API. Version for TDD and FDD.
    ...  If parameter deactivate_parallel_dl_test_for_tdd is True, parallel LTE DL Test Model E-TM1.1 will be also terminated
    ...  in case of TDD cell configuration.

    [Arguments]  ${distname_realtime}
    ...          ${test_model}
    ...          ${connection}
    ...          ${timeout}=60
    ...          ${deactivate_parallel_dl_test_for_tdd}=${True}

    ${cell_technology}=                                     admin_info_model.get_cell_technology
    ...                                                     connection=${connection}
    ...                                                     cell_type=lte
    ...                                                     cell_id=${distname_realtime[-1]}

    Run keyword if       ${deactivate_parallel_dl_test_for_tdd} and '${cell_technology}'=='TDD'
    ...   Run keywords
    ...   Robot Log Operation                               Stopping LTE Downlink Test (E-TM1.1)...
    ...   AND
    ...   tm_lte_adm.stop_lte_downlink_test                 distname_realtime=${distname_realtime}
    ...                                                     connection=${connection}
    ...                                                     timeout=${timeout}

    Robot log operation                                     Stopping LTE UL ${test_model} test model...
    ${stop_test_result}                                     tm_lte_adm.stop_lte_uplink_test
    ...                                                     distname_realtime=${distname_realtime}
    ...                                                     timeout=${timeout}
    ...                                                     connection=${connection}
    Should Be Equal As Strings                              ${stop_test_result['status']}
    ...                                                     Succeeded
    ...                                                     msg=LTE UL ${test_model} test model stop failed: ${stop_test_result['msg']}
    Robot Log Step                                          LTE UL ${test_model} test model has stopped successfully.

LTE UL Test Model Activation Teardown
    [Arguments]  ${distname_realtime}
    ...          ${test_model}
    ...          ${connection}
    ...          ${timeout}=60
    ${active_tm}                                            tm_common_adm.get_active_tests
    ...                                                     connection=${connection}
    ...                                                     timeout=${timeout}
    Run keyword if        "${active_tm}"!="[]"              Run keyword and ignore error
    ...                                                     Stop LTE Uplink Test
    ...                                                     distname_realtime=${distname_realtime}
    ...                                                     test_model=${test_model}
    ...                                                     timeout=${timeout}
    ...                                                     connection=${connection}
    ...                                                     deactivate_parallel_dl_test_for_tdd=${True}
    ...  ELSE                                               Return From Keyword
    ${active_tm}                                            tm_common_adm.get_active_tests
    ...                                                     connection=${connection}
    ...                                                     timeout=${timeout}
    Run keyword if        "${active_tm}"!="[]"              Perform Reset Site And Wait For OnAir

Start NR Uplink Test Model
    [Documentation]  Starts Uplink Test Model via Admin API. It goes in two manners - if cell technology is TDD,
    ...              then downlink test module is also needed to run in parallel. FDD cells do not need such operation.
    [Arguments]      ${connection}
    ...              ${cell_distname}
    ...              ${frc_index}
    ...              ${nrarfcn_dl}
    ...              ${nrarfcn_ul}
    ...              ${physical_cell_id}
    ...              ${rep_time_interval}=1
    ...              ${ru_mode}=NR_only
    ...              ${prb_offset}=0
    ...              ${beam_pattern_id}=0
    ...              ${timeout}=30

    ${beam_pattern_id}                                      tm_startup.prepare_beam_id_parameter
    ...                                                     ${beam_pattern_id}

    Robot Log Operation                                     Starting NR Uplink ${frc_index} Test Model...
    ${start_test_result}                                    nr_conformance_adm.start_5g_uplink_test
    ...                                                     dist_name=${cell_distname}
    ...                                                     frc_index=${frc_index.replace("-", "_")}
    ...                                                     connection=${connection}
    ...                                                     phys_cell_id=${physical_cell_id}
    ...                                                     nrarfcn_ul=${nrarfcn_ul}
    ...                                                     nrarfcn_dl=${nrarfcn_dl}
    ...                                                     timeout=${timeout}
    ...                                                     beam_pattern_id=${beam_pattern_id}
    ...                                                     interval=${rep_time_interval}
    ...                                                     prb_offset=${prb_offset}
    ...                                                     ru_mode=${ru_mode}

    Should Be Equal As Strings                              ${start_test_result['status']}    Succeeded
    ...                                                     msg=NR Uplink ${frc_index} Test start failed: ${start_test_result['msg']}

