Verify NR Uplink Test Results
    [Documentation]  Verifies the results of NR Uplink Test Model.
    ...              Validator checks the following requirements:
    ...              *Before validation, the initial results are removed; by default, the first measurement is removed.*
    ...              | 1. | If the reporting time interval is correct across all measurements. Additional check not from QC |
    ...              | 2. | If the RSSI values are within the specified deviation, default is 3dB. |
    ...              | 3. | If the sum of unreceived and defective blocks is constant across all measurements. \
    ...                     - *allowed percentage of sum values that can be incorrect is 5% by default.* |
    ...              | 4. | If the sum of unreceived and defective blocks corresponds to the number of uplink slots in the \
    ...                     measurement interval. |
    ...              | 5. | If the sum of unreceived and defective bits is constant across all measurements. \
    ...                     - *allowed percentage of sum values that can be incorrect is 5% by default.* |
    ...              | 6. | If the sum of unreceived and defective bits corresponds to the number of transmitted bits in the \
    ...                     measurement interval. |
    ...              If any of the requirements is not met, the test will fail.
    
    [Arguments]      ${results}
    ...              ${uplink_slots}
    ...              ${rep_time_interval}
    ...              ${frc_index}
    ...              ${rssi_deviation}=3
    ...              ${blocks_sum_threshold}=5
    ...              ${bits_sum_threshold}=5
    ...              ${initial_measurements_to_remove}=1

    Robot Log Operation                                     Validating NR Uplink ${frc_index} Test Results...
    ${parsed_results}=                                      report_parser.parse_admin_test_results
    ...                                                     results=${results}
    ${parsed_results}=                                      report_parser.remove_initial_results
    ...                                                     results=${parsed_results}
    ...                                                     first_n_to_remove=${initial_measurements_to_remove}

    validator.validate_reporting_time_interval              timestamps=${parsed_results['timeReceived']}
    ...                                                     reporting_interval=${rep_time_interval}
    ...                                                     time_format=time_str
    rssi_validator.verify_rssi_values_v2                    rssi_values=${parsed_results['rssi']}
    ...                                                     deviation=${rssi_deviation}
    validator.validate_sum_unreceived_defective_blocks_with_ul_slots
    ...                                                     results=${parsed_results}
    ...                                                     uplink_slots=${uplink_slots}
    ...                                                     measurement_interval=${rep_time_interval}
    ...                                                     blocks_sum_threshold=${blocks_sum_threshold}
    validator.validate_sum_unreceived_defective_with_transmitted_bits
    ...                                                     results=${parsed_results}
    ...                                                     frc_index=${frc_index}
    ...                                                     bits_sum_threshold=${bits_sum_threshold}
